        <has-link rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://patents.google.com/patent/US20200074086A1/en</has-link>
        <kb-reference-title>Methods and systems for hardware and firmware security monitoring</kb-reference-title>
        <kb-abstract>Systems and methods are provided herein for monitoring and identifying potential security vulnerabilities in hardware and / or firmware of host devices .</kb-abstract>
        <kb-author>Yuriy Bulygin, Oleksandr Bazhaniuk</kb-author>
        <kb-organization>ECLYPSIUM , Inc</kb-organization>
