3. Concept drift. (2023, April 17). In _Wikipedia_. [Link](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Concept_drift).
4. 8 Concept Drift Detection Methods. (n.d.). In _Aporia Learning Center_. [Link](https://www.aporia.com/learn/data-drift/concept-drift-detection-methods/).</kb-article>
        <rdfs:label>Decision Tree</rdfs:label>
