Analytics Vidhya. (2021). Deep Convolutional Generative Adversarial Network (DCGAN) for Beginners. [Link](https://www.analyticsvidhya.com/blog/2021/07/deep-convolutional-generative-adversarial-network-dcgan-for-beginners/)</kb-article>
