    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://d3fend.mitre.org/ontologies/d3fend.owl#DefaultUserAccount">
        <definition>Default accounts are those that are built-into an OS, such as the Guest or Administrator accounts on Windows systems or default factory/provider set accounts on other types of systems, software, or devices.</definition>
