    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://d3fend.mitre.org/ontologies/d3fend.owl#Model-basedPolicyOptimization">
        <definition>Model-based policy optimization (MBPO) is a model-based, online, off-policy reinforcement learning algorithm. For more information on the different types of reinforcement learning agents</definition>
