        <definition>the moving-average model (MA model) is an approach for modeling univariate time series and specifies that the output variable is cross-correlated with a non-identical to itself random-variable.</definition>
        <kb-article>## Refrences
Wikipedia. (n.d.). Moving average model. [Link](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moving_average_model)</kb-article>
