    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://d3fend.mitre.org/ontologies/d3fend.owl#RPCNetworkTraffic">
        <definition>RPC network traffic is network traffic related to remote procedure calls between network nodes..This includes only network traffic conforming to a standard RPC protocol; not custom protocols.</definition>
